      "Differentiation": "• Moderate – portability and ‘professional-grade’ combined with desktop size is a unique selling point. However, similar desktop CNC machines exist.",
      "Impact and Evidence Plan": "• Limited – relies heavily on testimonials and claims of durability. No concrete evidence of impact beyond prototyping.",
      "Risk Awareness and Mitigation": "• Adequate – acknowledges component sourcing, assembly, and logistics. Prototype validation is a reasonable mitigation, but not exhaustive."
