      "Clarity of Value Proposition": "• Strong – addresses a critical problem of digital authenticity and trust. The concept of ‘ethical fingerprints’ is conceptually sound.",
      "Market Size and Demand": "• Large and growing – ethical sourcing, supply chain transparency, and digital verification are increasingly important to brands and consumers. Target users are well-defined.",
      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• Conceptually feasible, but the technical details of fingerprint generation and ledger anchoring are somewhat vague. The proposed widget integration is a promising feature.",
